'''''The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth''''' is the expansion to ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth]]''. The DLC was released on October 30, 2015 and costs $10.99/£7.99. It was released on May 10, 2016 on Xbox One and PS4.

''For a list of the pre-release blog posts, see [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth (Pre-Release)]].''

= Features =
* [[Greed Mode]]: A new game mode with a heavy focus on risk/reward, featuring a new [[ending]] and [[Ultra Greed|final boss]].
* [[Blue Womb]]: A new area, featuring a new [[ending]] and [[Hush|final boss]].
* [[Daily Challenges|Daily Runs]]: Daily seeded runs with online leaderboards.
* Two new characters, [[Lilith]] and [[Keeper]].
* 95 new [[Items#Afterbirth Collectibles|items]] and 29 new [[Trinkets#Afterbirth Trinkets|trinkets]].
* New [[pickups]], [[chests]], [[pills]], and [[Cards and Runes|cards]].
* 10 new [[challenges]].
* 4 new alternate chapters: [[Burning Basement]], [[Flooded Caves]], [[Dank Depths]], and [[Scarred Womb]].
* Many new room layouts including tiny rooms, long hallways, and L-shaped rooms.
* New room types like trap rooms, double treasure rooms, and [[closets]].
* New special [[seeds]], along with a seed code combo page.
* An expanded [[Music#The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth|soundtrack]].
* An extra HUD option, allowing items picked up to be displayed on-screen.
* 9 new [[transformations]].
* New [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth#Bosses|bosses]], along with new variations of bosses introduced in Rebirth.
* New [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth#Monsters|monsters]].
* Updated item combo system.
* New [[Achievements#Afterbirth Achievements|achievements]].
* New [[Babies#Afterbirth Babies|co-op babies]].
* An improved [[Collection Page#Afterbirth Complete Collection Grid|collection page]] that shows item descriptions.

